 "remarks": "Steal away to your own private playground in this beautiful contemporary with POOL AND SPORT COURT, on a lovely neighborhood road. Set down a private driveway through lighted stone pillars, the house welcomes you with lush, mature landscaping. A large foyer opens to the sunny living room with beaded vaulted ceilings, floor-to ceiling fireplace and wall-to-wall sliders to a large deck that overlooks the pool and grounds, with a special touch reflecting the owners' love of soccer. The updated kitchen with double ovens, sub-zero fridge, center island and adjacent dining area offers a spacious gathering space with plenty of options for creating memorable meals. The screened porch offers a escape and more dining options in almost all seasons. Wake up in the oversized PRIMARY BR ON FIRST FLOOR to a beautiful view, sliders to the deck, and plentiful closet space plus a full bath. A second BR (currently being used as an office) and full bath is on the first floor. The lower level includes three more bedrooms, 2 full bathrooms, sauna, laundry room and a handsome Family Room with fireplace and sliders. Want the grandkids to visit, and have a lot to do, but don't want too much space when they are not there? This is a sanctuary for peace and quiet, that opens up to a joyful celebration of activity and camaraderie when shared with family and friends, on a street known for it's own joyful camaraderie!",
